---
const waHref = "https://wa.me/34653039281?text=Hola%2C%20quiero%20un%20diagn%C3%B3stico%20gratis%20de%20mi%20web%2Fapp%20hecha%20con%20IA";
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import HectorDarkShirt from '../../assets/content/hector-dark-shirt.png'
import HectorBlueSuit from '../../assets/content/hector_blue_suit.png'
---
<header class="cs-hero">
  <div class="cs-hero-confidence" aria-hidden="true">
    <Image
      class="cs-hero-confidence-photo"
      src={HectorBlueSuit}
      alt=""
      loading="eager"
      width="520"
      height="780"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="cs-wrap cs-hero-grid">
    <div class="cs-hero-copy">
      <div class="cs-eyebrow">Especialista en apps y webs creadas con IA</div>
      <h1>Tu app la construyó una IA.<br>Yo hago que funcione de verdad.</h1>
      <p class="cs-lead">Reviso, arreglo y blindo aplicaciones creadas con Lovable, Bolt, Replit, Cursor y otras IAs, para que puedas lanzarlas sin miedo a que se rompan.</p>
      <div class="cs-hero-cta">
        <a class="cs-btn cs-btn-primary" href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Pide tu diagnóstico gratis
        </a>
        <span class="cs-hero-note">Respuesta en &lt;24h · Sin compromiso</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-hero-person">
        <span class="cs-hero-person-photo" aria-hidden="true">
          <Image
            class="cs-hero-person-photo-image"
            src={HectorDarkShirt}
            alt="Hombre joven en traje"
            loading="eager"
            width="110"
            height="110"
          />
        </span>
        <p class="cs-hero-person-text">Te responde <strong>Héctor</strong> en persona — no una agencia, no un bot.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cs-terminal">
      <div class="cs-terminal-head">
        <div class="cs-terminal-bar"><span class="cs-dot-r"></span><span class="cs-dot-y"></span><span class="cs-dot-g"></span></div>
        <div class="cs-terminal-title">diagnóstico — tu-app-ia/</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-term-body">
        <div class="cs-term-line cs-cmd cs-typewriter">analizando tu-app-ia/ ...</div>
        <div class="cs-term-line cs-bad">✗ auth.js — contraseñas sin cifrar</div>
        <div class="cs-term-line cs-bad">✗ api/ — sin validación de datos</div>
        <div class="cs-term-line cs-bad">✗ index.jsx — errores sin controlar</div>
        <div class="cs-term-line cs-good">✓ arquitectura reorganizada</div>
        <div class="cs-term-line cs-good">✓ seguridad reforzada</div>
        <div class="cs-term-line cs-good">✓ lista para producción</div>
        <div class="cs-term-line cs-prompt">$ <span class="cs-term-cursor">▌</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .cs-hero{position:relative;padding:76px 0 40px;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate;}
  .cs-hero-grid{position:relative;z-index:2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;}
  .cs-hero-copy{position:relative;z-index:3;}
  .cs-hero-confidence{
    position:absolute;z-index:1;right:2%;bottom:-72px;width:min(39vw,520px);height:min(47vw,650px);
    pointer-events:none;filter:drop-shadow(0 28px 34px rgba(18,21,28,.18));
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .cs-hero-confidence-photo{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 8%;}
  @media (max-width:1100px){
    .cs-hero-confidence{right:-3%;width:min(43vw,460px);height:560px;bottom:-72px;opacity:.95;}
  }
  @media (max-width:900px){
    .cs-hero{padding-top:56px;}
    .cs-hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:38px;}
    .cs-hero-confidence{right:-7%;bottom:-110px;width:340px;height:430px;opacity:.14;}
  }
  .cs-hero p.cs-lead{font-size:18px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:20px;max-width:520px;}
  .cs-hero-cta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin-top:32px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .cs-hero-note{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-muted);}

  .cs-hero-person{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:28px;}
  .cs-hero-person-photo{
    width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;display:block;
    border:2px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 4px 12px -4px rgba(18,21,28,.35);
    flex-shrink:0;position:relative;background:var(--paper-2);
  }
  .cs-hero-person-photo-image{
    width:100%;height:100%;max-width:none !important;object-fit:cover;object-position:38% 18%;
    transform:none;
  }
  .cs-hero-person-text{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-muted);max-width:280px;}
  .cs-hero-person-text strong{color:var(--ink);}

  .cs-terminal{
    background:var(--ink);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:20px 22px 26px;
    box-shadow:0 30px 60px -24px rgba(18,21,28,.45);
    border:1px solid var(--ink-line);
    position:relative;z-index:3;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .cs-terminal::after{
    content:'';position:absolute;left:0;right:0;height:60px;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(53,89,224,0) 0%, rgba(53,89,224,.06) 50%, rgba(53,89,224,0) 100%);
    animation:cs-scanline 5s linear infinite;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  @keyframes cs-scanline{
    0%{top:-60px;}
    100%{top:100%;}
  }

  .cs-terminal-bar{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:16px;}
  .cs-terminal-bar span{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;}
  .cs-dot-r{background:#E9584A;}
  .cs-dot-y{background:#E8B94B;}
  .cs-dot-g{background:#3FBE6B;}
  .cs-terminal-title{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-muted-on-ink);margin-left:10px;}
  .cs-terminal-head{display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px;position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .cs-term-body{position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .cs-term-line{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:13.5px;line-height:2;opacity:0;transform:translateY(4px);animation:cs-tline .45s ease forwards;}
  .cs-term-line.cs-cmd{color:var(--text-muted-on-ink);}
  .cs-term-line.cs-bad{color:var(--danger);}
  .cs-term-line.cs-good{color:var(--success);}
  .cs-term-line.cs-prompt{color:var(--success);font-weight:600;}

  .cs-typewriter{
    display:inline-block;
    white-space:nowrap;
    overflow:hidden;
    width:0;
    border-right:2px solid var(--text-muted-on-ink);
    animation:cs-typewriter .9s steps(24,end) forwards, cs-tline 0s .9s forwards, cs-caret-blink .8s step-end 4;
    animation-delay:.5s, .5s, .5s;
  }
  .cs-typewriter::before{content:'$ ';}
  @keyframes cs-typewriter{from{width:0;}to{width:24ch;}}
  @keyframes cs-caret-blink{50%{border-color:transparent;}}

  .cs-term-line:nth-child(2){animation-delay:1.5s;}
  .cs-term-line:nth-child(3){animation-delay:1.95s;}
  .cs-term-line:nth-child(4){animation-delay:2.4s;}
  .cs-term-line:nth-child(5){animation-delay:3.1s;}
  .cs-term-line:nth-child(6){animation-delay:3.6s;}
  .cs-term-line:nth-child(7){animation-delay:4.1s;}
  .cs-term-line.cs-prompt{animation-delay:4.6s;}
  @keyframes cs-tline{to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}

  .cs-term-cursor{display:inline-block;animation:cs-blink 1s step-end infinite;}
  @keyframes cs-blink{0%,50%{opacity:1;}51%,100%{opacity:0;}}

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .cs-term-line{animation:none;opacity:1;transform:none;}
    .cs-typewriter{width:24ch;border-right:none;animation:none;}
    .cs-terminal::after{animation:none;display:none;}
    .cs-term-cursor{animation:none;}
  }
</style>
